# Never upload these to Vercel.
#
# .research/ holds raw 2GIS extractions, photo originals, QA screenshots and the
# reference-project clone — megabytes of material that is not part of the build.
# data/ holds the booking store, which is real customer personal data and must
# never travel inside a deployment artifact.
.research/
data/
media-output/
.backup/
coverage/
*.log

# Platform-managed.
.next/
node_modules/
.vercel/
